{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a compact, polished horizontally scrollable sub-category section for collection pages, matching the existing Bluekites store design. Use editable text chips/cards, touch scrolling, keyboard access and accessible previous/next controls. Each item has an editable label and optional destination: link only when a real destination is configured; otherwise display plain text without fake links. Make section heading and parent collection assignment editable. Show only the appropriate group for the current parent collection, never every group on every collection. Include these complete groups from the merchant spreadsheet, ignoring numeric row markers. Surgical Products: Airway Management; Bandages & Tapes; Catheters & Drainage; Dental Care; Diagnostic & Monitoring Devices; Dialysis & Renal Care; Disinfection & Antiseptics; Feeding & Nutrition; Home & Patient Care; Hospital Equipment & Supplies; Hospital Garments; Incontinence / Continence Care; Syringe & Injection Supplies; Laboratory Products; Maternity & Neonatal Care; Ophthalmology; Ortho Care; Ostomy Care; Pharmaceuticals & Medications; Protective Equipment (PPE); Protein Powder & Supplements; Respiratory Care; Surgical Supplies; Surgical Sutures; Urology; Wound Care. Handrub & Disinfectants (the sheet's first Healthcare column): Hospital Solutions; Pharmaceutical / Industrial Solution; Sporicidal Disinfectant; Surface Disinfectant; Hand Sanitizer; Instrument Disinfectant; Surgical Hand Scrub; Accessories; Inhalation Anesthetics; General Purpose Disinfectants; Linen Disinfectant. Healthcare (second Healthcare column): Health Must Haves; Breathe Easy; Skin Care; Vitamins & Supplements; Healthcare Devices; Sexual Wellness; Sports Nutrition; Pet Care; Diabetes Essentials; Health Food and Drinks; Homeopathy Care; Ayurvedic Care; Health Concern; Mother and Baby Care; Personal Care. Food and Gourmet: Honey; Cooking Oil; Apple Cider Vinegar; Herbal Juices; Hill Turmeric; Jaggery Amla Candy; Wellness Oils; Chyawanprash; Nuts in Honey; Stevia; Shilajit; Saffron; Mouth Freshner; Condiments; Masala Chai; Premium Tea (Leaf, Dust & Fanning); Spiced Tea; Haldi Doodh; Cranberry Iced Tea; Green Tea Bags; Instant Tea Premix; Coffee Premix (Cappuccino); Frothy Coffee; Mocha; Cappuccino; Latte; Flavoured Coffee; Iced Coffee. Home and Kitchenware: Bottles & Flasks; Tableware; Lunchboxes; Casseroles; Cookware; Storage; Home Essentials; Appliances; Gifting; Spare Parts. Packaging and supplies: Boxes; Bags; Tapes; Rolls; Pouches; Stickers & Labels; Gift Packaging; Food Packaging; Sustainable Packaging; Compostable Packaging; Protective Packaging; Packaging Kits & Essentials; Branded Products; RePac; Warehouse Supplies. Cosmetics: Skin Care; Hair Care; Body Care; Men’s Care; Baby Care; Makeup; Fragrance; Lip Care; Eye Care. Apparel: Men; Women; Kids; Innerwear; Footwear; Accessories; Bags; Jewellery; Watches; Home; Beauty; GenZ. Existing parent collection handles: surgical-products, raman-weil (Handrub & Disinfectants), healthcare-services (Healthcare), food-and-gourmet, handmade-cosmetics (Cosmetics), bluekites-apparels (Apparel). Offer editable parent pickers for Home and Kitchenware and Packaging and supplies, leaving them unassigned until selected rather than inventing destinations. Existing subcategory collection Honey is /collections/honey; other related collections exist but do not assume differently named collections are equivalent. Keep labels without verified URLs as plain text. Preserve existing product grids and other sections. No empty subcategory pages should be created.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% assign active_group = '' %}
{% if collection %}
  {% if collection.handle == 'surgical-products' %}{% assign active_group = 'surgical' %}
  {% elsif collection.handle == 'raman-weil' %}{% assign active_group = 'handrub' %}
  {% elsif collection.handle == 'healthcare-services' %}{% assign active_group = 'healthcare' %}
  {% elsif collection.handle == 'food-and-gourmet' %}{% assign active_group = 'food' %}
  {% elsif collection.handle == 'handmade-cosmetics' %}{% assign active_group = 'cosmetics' %}
  {% elsif collection.handle == 'bluekites-apparels' %}{% assign active_group = 'apparel' %}
  {% elsif block.settings.home_parent != blank and collection.id == block.settings.home_parent.id %}{% assign active_group = 'home' %}
  {% elsif block.settings.packaging_parent != blank and collection.id == block.settings.packaging_parent.id %}{% assign active_group = 'packaging' %}
  {% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% assign group_items = '' %}
{% case active_group %}
  {% when 'surgical' %}{% assign group_items = block.settings.surgical_items %}
  {% when 'handrub' %}{% assign group_items = block.settings.handrub_items %}
  {% when 'healthcare' %}{% assign group_items = block.settings.healthcare_items %}
  {% when 'food' %}{% assign group_items = block.settings.food_items %}
  {% when 'home' %}{% assign group_items = block.settings.home_items %}
  {% when 'packaging' %}{% assign group_items = block.settings.packaging_items %}
  {% when 'cosmetics' %}{% assign group_items = block.settings.cosmetics_items %}
  {% when 'apparel' %}{% assign group_items = block.settings.apparel_items %}
{% endcase %}
{% if active_group != blank and group_items != blank %}
  {% style %}
    .ai-subcats-{{ ai_gen_id }} { display:block; width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%; max-width:100%; margin:18px auto; color:#000; }
    .ai-subcats-{{ ai_gen_id }}__top { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; margin-bottom:10px; }
    .ai-subcats-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading { margin:0; font-family:var(--font-heading--family, sans-serif); font-size:18px; line-height:1.3; }
    .ai-subcats-{{ ai_gen_id }}__controls { display:flex; gap:6px; }
    .ai-subcats-{{ ai_gen_id }}__control { display:grid; place-items:center; width:34px; height:34px; border:1px solid #d8d8d8; border-radius:50%; background:#fff; color:#000; cursor:pointer; }
    .ai-subcats-{{ ai_gen_id }}__control:disabled { opacity:.4; cursor:not-allowed; }
    .ai-subcats-{{ ai_gen_id }}__list { display:flex; gap:9px; overflow-x:auto; padding:3px 2px 10px; scroll-behavior:smooth; scrollbar-width:thin; }
    .ai-subcats-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item { flex:0 0 auto; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; min-height:40px; padding:9px 15px; border:1px solid #dedede; border-radius:24px; background:#fff; color:#171717; font:500 13px/1.35 var(--font-body--family, sans-serif); text-decoration:none; }
    a.ai-subcats-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item:hover { border-color:#000f9f; color:#000f9f; }
    .ai-subcats-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item:focus-visible,.ai-subcats-{{ ai_gen_id }}__control:focus-visible { outline:2px solid #000f9f; outline-offset:3px; }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { .ai-subcats-{{ ai_gen_id }}__list { scroll-behavior:auto; } }
  {% endstyle %}
  <div class="ai-subcats-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-subcats {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
    <div class="ai-subcats-{{ ai_gen_id }}__top"><h2 class="ai-subcats-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2><div class="ai-subcats-{{ ai_gen_id }}__controls"><button class="ai-subcats-{{ ai_gen_id }}__control" type="button" data-prev aria-label="Scroll categories left"><span aria-hidden="true">&#8249;</span></button><button class="ai-subcats-{{ ai_gen_id }}__control" type="button" data-next aria-label="Scroll categories right"><span aria-hidden="true">&#8250;</span></button></div></div>
    <div class="ai-subcats-{{ ai_gen_id }}__list" data-list tabindex="0" aria-label="{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}">
      {% assign entries = group_items | split: '\n' %}
      {% for entry in entries %}{% assign item_label = entry | strip %}{% if item_label != blank %}{% if item_label == 'Honey' %}<a class="ai-subcats-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item" href="/collections/honey">{{ item_label | escape }}</a>{% else %}<span class="ai-subcats-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item">{{ item_label | escape }}</span>{% endif %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
  <script>
    (() => {
      const root = document.querySelector('.ai-subcats-{{ ai_gen_id }}[data-subcats]');
      if (!root) return;
      const list = root.querySelector('[data-list]');
      const previous = root.querySelector('[data-prev]');
      const next = root.querySelector('[data-next]');
      const update = () => { previous.disabled = list.scrollLeft <= 0; next.disabled = list.scrollLeft + list.clientWidth >= list.scrollWidth - 1; };
      previous.addEventListener('click', () => list.scrollBy({ left: -list.clientWidth * 0.8, behavior: 'smooth' }));
      next.addEventListener('click', () => list.scrollBy({ left: list.clientWidth * 0.8, behavior: 'smooth' }));
      list.addEventListener('scroll', update, { passive: true });
      window.addEventListener('resize', update);
      update();
    })();
  </script>
{% endif %}
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Collection subcategories",
  "settings": [
    {"type":"text","id":"heading","label":"Heading","default":"Shop by category"},
    {"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},
    {"type":"header","content":"Parent collections"},
    {"type":"collection","id":"home_parent","label":"Home and Kitchenware parent"},
    {"type":"collection","id":"packaging_parent","label":"Packaging and supplies parent"},
    {"type":"header","content":"Surgical products"},
    {"type":"textarea","id":"surgical_items","label":"Labels, one per line","default":"Airway Management\nBandages & Tapes\nCatheters & Drainage\nDental Care\nDiagnostic & Monitoring Devices\nDialysis & Renal Care\nDisinfection & Antiseptics\nFeeding & Nutrition\nHome & Patient Care\nHospital Equipment & Supplies\nHospital Garments\nIncontinence / Continence Care\nSyringe & Injection Supplies\nLaboratory Products\nMaternity & Neonatal Care\nOphthalmology\nOrtho Care\nOstomy Care\nPharmaceuticals & Medications\nProtective Equipment (PPE)\nProtein Powder & Supplements\nRespiratory Care\nSurgical Supplies\nSurgical Sutures\nUrology\nWound Care"},
    {"type":"header","content":"Handrub and disinfectants"},
    {"type":"textarea","id":"handrub_items","label":"Labels, one per line","default":"Hospital Solutions\nPharmaceutical / Industrial Solution\nSporicidal Disinfectant\nSurface Disinfectant\nHand Sanitizer\nInstrument Disinfectant\nSurgical Hand Scrub\nAccessories\nInhalation Anesthetics\nGeneral Purpose Disinfectants\nLinen Disinfectant"},
    {"type":"header","content":"Healthcare"},
    {"type":"textarea","id":"healthcare_items","label":"Labels, one per line","default":"Health Must Haves\nBreathe Easy\nSkin Care\nVitamins & Supplements\nHealthcare Devices\nSexual Wellness\nSports Nutrition\nPet Care\nDiabetes Essentials\nHealth Food and Drinks\nHomeopathy Care\nAyurvedic Care\nHealth Concern\nMother and Baby Care\nPersonal Care"},
    {"type":"header","content":"Food and gourmet"},
    {"type":"textarea","id":"food_items","label":"Labels, one per line","default":"Honey\nCooking Oil\nApple Cider Vinegar\nHerbal Juices\nHill Turmeric\nJaggery Amla Candy\nWellness Oils\nChyawanprash\nNuts in Honey\nStevia\nShilajit\nSaffron\nMouth Freshner\nCondiments\nMasala Chai\nPremium Tea (Leaf, Dust & Fanning)\nSpiced Tea\nHaldi Doodh\nCranberry Iced Tea\nGreen Tea Bags\nInstant Tea Premix\nCoffee Premix (Cappuccino)\nFrothy Coffee\nMocha\nCappuccino\nLatte\nFlavoured Coffee\nIced Coffee"},
    {"type":"header","content":"Home and kitchenware"},
    {"type":"textarea","id":"home_items","label":"Labels, one per line","default":"Bottles & Flasks\nTableware\nLunchboxes\nCasseroles\nCookware\nStorage\nHome Essentials\nAppliances\nGifting\nSpare Parts"},
    {"type":"header","content":"Packaging and supplies"},
    {"type":"textarea","id":"packaging_items","label":"Labels, one per line","default":"Boxes\nBags\nTapes\nRolls\nPouches\nStickers & Labels\nGift Packaging\nFood Packaging\nSustainable Packaging\nCompostable Packaging\nProtective Packaging\nPackaging Kits & Essentials\nBranded Products\nRePac\nWarehouse Supplies"},
    {"type":"header","content":"Cosmetics"},
    {"type":"textarea","id":"cosmetics_items","label":"Labels, one per line","default":"Skin Care\nHair Care\nBody Care\nMen’s Care\nBaby Care\nMakeup\nFragrance\nLip Care\nEye Care"},
    {"type":"header","content":"Apparel"},
    {"type":"textarea","id":"apparel_items","label":"Labels, one per line","default":"Men\nWomen\nKids\nInnerwear\nFootwear\nAccessories\nBags\nJewellery\nWatches\nHome\nBeauty\nGenZ"}
  ],
  "presets": [{"name":"Collection subcategories"}],
  "tag": null,
  "class": "collection-subcategories-block"
}
{% endschema %}